# Heartbeat runtime artifacts — per-run logs and the 2-day cadence stamp files.
# These churn every run and are never canon; keep them out of git so a stray
# `git add -A` elsewhere can't sweep them in. The wrappers commit only their
# scoped outputs (steward machinery + plan.md + board, or the Shopkeeper bundle
# markdown + board note) via the palace committer — never this dir's runtime.
logs/
.last-steward-batch
.last-shopkeeper-sweep
# global pause flag toggled by STIGMERGY (STEWARDS deck) — per-machine runtime
# state, never canon. The wrappers no-op while it is present.
.paused
